# Local state is tens of megabytes, changes every day, and is fully
# rebuildable from a crawl - never commit it.
data/state/
data/**/*.tmp

# The change log (data/changes/) and rollups (data/rollups/) are deliberately
# NOT ignored. They are small, append-only, and cannot be rebuilt from any
# upstream source, and committing them gives the measurements a tamper-evident
# public history. See README.md.
